# Allow-list packaging: exclude everything, then re-include what ships.
# vsce always adds package.json, and README/CHANGELOG/LICENSE when present.
**

!dist/extension.js
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!LICENSE.md
!LICENSE.txt
!SECURITY.md
!images/**

# Never ship source maps, even if a dev build left them behind.
**/*.map
